text.section:
When the affairs of a limited partnership have been wound up pursuant to § 50-73.51, it shall file a certificate of cancellation with the Commission. The certificate shall set forth:

The name of the limited partnership;


The effective date of its certificate of limited partnership;


The reason for filing the certificate of cancellation;


A statement that the limited partnership has completed the winding up of its affairs; and


Any other information the partners determine to include therein.
